sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Jupyter / CLI)
    participant SDK as CodeFlare SDK<br/>(Python Client)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Kueue as Kueue Controller
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay Operator
    participant RayHead as Ray Head Pod<br/>8265/TCP
    participant RouteAPI as OpenShift Route API
    participant GatewayAPI as Gateway API
    participant GWConfig as RHOAI GatewayConfig

    Note over User,GWConfig: Flow 1: Cluster Creation

    User->>SDK: cf.clusters.create(ClusterConfiguration)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET LocalQueues<br/>Auth: kube-authkit (Bearer/OIDC/SA)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Available queues + priorities
    SDK->>K8sAPI: CREATE RayCluster CR<br/>Auth: kube-authkit
    K8sAPI->>KubeRay: Watch event: new RayCluster
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: CREATE Ray head + worker pods
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RayCluster status: Ready
    SDK-->>User: Cluster ready

    Note over User,GWConfig: Flow 2: Dashboard URL Discovery

    User->>SDK: cluster.dashboard_uri()
    SDK->>RouteAPI: GET Routes (ray-dashboard-*)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    alt Route found
        RouteAPI-->>SDK: Route URL
    else No Route
        SDK->>GatewayAPI: GET HTTPRoutes<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
        alt HTTPRoute found
            GatewayAPI-->>SDK: Gateway hostname + path
        else No HTTPRoute
            SDK->>GWConfig: GET GatewayConfig CR<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
            GWConfig-->>SDK: Gateway hostname
        end
    end
    SDK-->>User: Dashboard URL

    Note over User,GWConfig: Flow 3: TLS Certificate Generation & Job Submission

    User->>SDK: cf.jobs.submit(script, ClusterConfiguration)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET Secret (ca-secret-*)<br/>Auth: kube-authkit
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: CA certificate + key
    SDK->>SDK: Generate TLS client cert<br/>(RSA-3072, SHA-256)
    SDK->>SDK: Write certs to ~/.local/share/codeflare/tls/<br/>(0600 permissions)
    SDK->>RayHead: POST /api/jobs/<br/>8265/TCP HTTPS mTLS
    RayHead-->>SDK: Job ID + status
    SDK-->>User: Job submitted
